1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Jason sent the money downhill. The cable
car came back empty, and Lucia

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,000
smiled.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Earlier, their buyer demanded delivery
without witnesses. Lucia noticed

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,000
the cabin's second floor hatch.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,500
The buyer controlled the lower station.
He could take the bag, and cancel

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,000
payment.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,789
Jason wanted to ride along. Lucia tucked
the freight tag through the hatch

8
00:00:25,789 --> 00:00:28,000
and closed it on the ribbon.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,812
Downhill, somebody pulled the yellow bag
out. The snagged ribbon tore

10
00:00:32,812 --> 00:00:35,000
cleanly, leaving half the weight.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,053
When the cabin returned, Lucia
photographed the half tag against the

12
00:00:39,053 --> 00:00:42,000
empty floor and sent their buyer one
message.

13
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,684
Paid freight, confirmed received. The
buyer's own insurance camera covered

14
00:00:45,684 --> 00:00:49,000
that floor. He transferred their fee
instead of arguing.

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,353
Jason had shipped cash. Lucia had
shipped proof, and the proof came back

16
00:00:54,353 --> 00:00:56,000
on the return ride.
